WEBVTT

00:38.180 --> 00:40.230
Prisoner 1001 is free.

00:40.230 --> 00:42.920
We should report this to the chief.

00:41.770 --> 00:42.920
No.

00:42.920 --> 00:44.940
A written apology won't cut it this time.

00:44.940 --> 00:47.190
Then what are we supposed to do?

00:47.190 --> 00:48.780
Put him back in his chamber.

00:48.780 --> 00:49.950
We'll all go in at once.

00:53.000 --> 00:54.440
You're...

01:03.960 --> 01:04.960
You bastard!

01:26.260 --> 01:28.720
U-Um, I...

01:33.880 --> 01:38.240
What? Um, I... Wait.

01:38.490 --> 01:41.070
Please don't.

03:37.110 --> 03:39.950
<i>All internment camp personnel,</i>

03:39.950 --> 03:45.250
<i>all cell doors and corridor partitions 
in Blocks 1 through 6 have been opened.</i>

03:45.830 --> 03:48.000
<i>Numerous prisoners are attempting to escape.</i>

03:48.000 --> 03:49.750
<i>Initiate countermeasures immediately.</i>

03:49.750 --> 03:52.000
<i>This is not a drill.</i>

03:52.000 --> 03:54.840
<i>I repeat, this is not a drill.</i>

03:56.040 --> 04:00.010
New Nightmare, National Security Bureau

03:56.090 --> 03:59.970
The location is Mayhem Internment 
Camp in Precinct 7.

04:00.010 --> 04:03.470
Head there immediately and
 report back on the situation.

04:03.810 --> 04:06.730
You may arm yourself with 
weapons greater than Class 5.

04:03.810 --> 04:06.770
NSB Director
Senior Executive Yamato

04:06.760 --> 04:08.270
Any questions?

04:08.270 --> 04:11.400
No questions, Director.

04:11.400 --> 04:15.400
I'll preserve the empire's peace 
with my supreme power.

04:15.730 --> 04:19.150
The NSB is the keystone 
of maintaining public order.

04:19.120 --> 04:23.120
Don't make light of 
the peace built by His Majesty.

04:19.490 --> 04:23.160
NSB Vice-Director
Executive Yuki

04:23.150 --> 04:25.870
Sure thing.

04:25.870 --> 04:27.370
Then hurry up and go.

04:27.410 --> 04:30.170
Yes, ma'am. Excuse me.

04:31.090 --> 04:35.460
How dare he behave so
insolently in your presence.

04:35.460 --> 04:37.010
I'll kill him someday.

04:37.010 --> 04:38.510
Leave him alone.

04:38.510 --> 04:41.140
But Brother...

04:44.350 --> 04:49.060
Capital Security Agency Operator
Executive Eekhout

04:45.220 --> 04:49.060
Despite how he seems, like you, 
he's an executive of this empire.

04:52.470 --> 04:54.060
<i>Initiating navigation.</i>

04:54.060 --> 04:55.690
Thank you.

04:56.190 --> 04:59.690
Anyway, Mayhem Internment Camp, huh?

04:59.990 --> 05:02.700
Mayhem Internment Camp, Prime Confiscated Item Storage

05:00.110 --> 05:01.530
I don't like the sound of that.

05:02.690 --> 05:04.950
Oh, come on!

05:04.950 --> 05:08.700
Even the confiscated item storage is open!

05:09.030 --> 05:10.450
I'm terribly sorry.

05:10.920 --> 05:13.210
The girl who fled imitated your voice

05:13.210 --> 05:15.840
to crack your phone's voice 
authentication system.

05:15.840 --> 05:18.420
But my phone is a secure domestic model.

05:18.420 --> 05:20.210
That's impossible.

05:20.890 --> 05:24.010
Anyway, this is really bad.

05:24.010 --> 05:27.430
Why'd she have to take this of all things?

05:27.430 --> 05:30.220
What am I going to tell the higher-ups?

05:30.940 --> 05:32.860
Either way, it doesn't make sense.

05:32.860 --> 05:35.320
Even if she cracked 
the authentication system,

05:35.320 --> 05:40.990
my authority level shouldn't have 
allowed her to open that chamber.

05:41.860 --> 05:47.610
It contained an SS threat
level long-term prisoner,

05:47.610 --> 05:51.120
the witch's apprentice, Adonis.

06:01.130 --> 06:04.460
Written-Style Summoning Magic: Gaine.

06:07.140 --> 06:10.100
<b>Written-Style
Summoning
Magic</b>

06:07.140 --> 06:10.100
<b>Gaine</b>

06:14.400 --> 06:15.360
What the...

06:19.280 --> 06:20.400
Now then.

06:20.400 --> 06:23.530
Time to kill every last citizen.

06:26.940 --> 06:33.160
I've searched the entire internment camp 
but found no sign of the boy.

06:33.160 --> 06:36.160
What? A building was struck by a shell?

06:36.160 --> 06:37.120
Roger that.

06:37.120 --> 06:39.160
I'll head there right away...

06:39.630 --> 06:43.930
after I've cleaned up 
the cause of this mess.

06:49.300 --> 06:51.930
No way. What am I going to do?

06:52.810 --> 06:54.560
This is my fault.

06:55.180 --> 06:59.270
It's because I couldn't stop him.

06:59.980 --> 07:02.940
Takuma, where should we go after this?

07:02.940 --> 07:04.860
Where do you want to go, Eri?

07:04.860 --> 07:06.720
What? Well...

07:05.900 --> 07:09.280
<i>The home security system you can 
count on to keep your family safe.</i>

07:09.280 --> 07:13.870
<i>The newest model of assistant robot, 
the Redian 2, is now on sale.</i>

07:13.870 --> 07:17.450
<i>Visit your nearest store to buy your own.</i>

07:17.450 --> 07:19.460
<i>Breaking news.</i>

07:19.710 --> 07:22.840
<i>We've received word that 
a massive artillery shell-like object</i>

07:22.840 --> 07:26.140
<i>was fired into a building 
in the business district.</i>

07:26.140 --> 07:28.210
<i>Though the extent of the damage is unclear.</i>

07:28.210 --> 07:30.970
<i>it may be a terrorist attack 
carried out by neighboring nations.</i>

07:30.970 --> 07:37.510
I doubt she'd praise me 
for what I'm about to do.

07:38.110 --> 07:41.730
<i>Getting revenge won't bring me back to life.</i>

07:41.730 --> 07:46.240
<i>You managed to escape so you should
just go enjoy your life, Adonis.</i>

07:47.450 --> 07:49.280
I bet she'd say that.

07:50.240 --> 07:53.750
That guy is talking 
to himself. What a creep.

07:53.750 --> 07:55.330
Just ignore him. Let's go.

07:56.580 --> 07:58.250
Ten years, huh?

07:59.590 --> 08:03.420
No matter how many years pass, 
I won't forget what happened.

08:04.460 --> 08:10.090
The look in your eyes, 
your voice, your words...

08:10.930 --> 08:11.850
I love—

08:17.390 --> 08:21.770
I loved you, too, Chloe.

08:26.780 --> 08:27.610
What is this?

08:27.610 --> 08:28.820
Watch out!

08:34.870 --> 08:37.330
<b>Written-Style
Summoning
Magic</b>

08:34.870 --> 08:37.330
<b>Grande</b>

08:49.180 --> 08:53.060
Yes, this is the Precinct 6
 Luden police box.

08:54.220 --> 08:56.930
What? A giant has appeared?

08:57.310 --> 08:58.940
Don't be ridiculous.

08:58.940 --> 09:01.240
Don't waste our time with prank calls.

09:02.390 --> 09:04.720
What? It's not a prank?

09:04.720 --> 09:07.690
In that case, what's your citizen number?

09:10.680 --> 09:15.580
Hey, don't you know this 
is a military facility?

09:15.940 --> 09:17.600
Are you okay?

09:17.600 --> 09:18.790
It's huge.

09:19.780 --> 09:21.700
I've never seen anything like it.

09:21.720 --> 09:24.010
Must be on drugs.

09:24.020 --> 09:25.800
Let's arrest him.

09:26.710 --> 09:29.670
HQ, this is the Luden police box.

09:29.670 --> 09:31.960
Transfer me to the narcotics department.

09:32.750 --> 09:36.470
Actually, no. Transfer me to the NSB.

09:44.730 --> 09:46.970
Eri! Eri!

09:46.970 --> 09:49.150
Help me, Eri!

09:49.150 --> 09:50.610
What is this?

09:58.610 --> 10:03.370
You'd better not run, Emperor Goethe.

10:04.370 --> 10:06.200
What's the situation?

10:06.620 --> 10:10.790
The enemy is one giant robot, 
country of origin unknown.

10:10.790 --> 10:13.590
It's passing through the business 
district and heading this way.

10:14.130 --> 10:16.300
It'll be passing through Precinct 5 shortly,

10:16.300 --> 10:18.590
but local defensive measures can't keep up.

10:18.590 --> 10:20.680
Have you informed His Majesty?

10:20.680 --> 10:23.140
Our report was blocked.

10:24.010 --> 10:28.100
According to Her Majesty the Queen, 
His Majesty is not well.

10:28.390 --> 10:29.600
Understood.

10:29.600 --> 10:33.440
By my authority, I'm declaring 
a state of emergency.

10:33.440 --> 10:36.400
Prioritize holding Defensive Line 4.

10:36.400 --> 10:39.360
Request air-ground support 
from all available aircraft.

10:39.360 --> 10:41.490
What about surface troops?

10:41.490 --> 10:43.950
Send in armored foot soldiers.

10:43.950 --> 10:46.360
I expect a limited confrontation.

10:46.370 --> 10:47.450
Roger.

10:52.540 --> 10:53.960
It's huge.

10:54.380 --> 10:56.710
I can't believe that thing can move.

10:56.710 --> 10:58.010
Brother,

10:58.010 --> 11:01.890
the boy and quill have gone missing 
from the internment camp.

11:01.890 --> 11:04.390
That thing must be powered by magic.

11:04.810 --> 11:06.930
Then that makes things simple.

11:06.930 --> 11:09.850
Where's the Magic Photon Suppression Device?

11:09.850 --> 11:11.650
The DAM?

11:11.940 --> 11:14.520
It's in underground storage.

11:14.520 --> 11:19.280
But I'm not sure a ten-year-old
 device will work properly.

11:20.200 --> 11:22.660
Yuki, it's in your hands.

11:22.660 --> 11:24.070
This is of national importance.

11:24.070 --> 11:24.910
Yes, sir.

11:25.660 --> 11:28.450
<i>A state of emergency has been declared.</i>

11:28.910 --> 11:33.670
<i>Citizens are to quickly evacuate 
to a safe location.</i>

11:36.130 --> 11:40.420
Help! Someone help!

11:40.880 --> 11:45.180
Defensive Line 4, main battery ready.

11:45.550 --> 11:48.430
Our target is a giant of unknown origin.

11:48.770 --> 11:49.930
Fire!

11:55.020 --> 11:56.770
What are you aiming at?

11:56.770 --> 11:58.570
Fire again!

12:01.950 --> 12:03.410
What's going on?

12:03.410 --> 12:05.820
<i>I don't know! The shells won't fly straight!</i>

12:06.240 --> 12:09.580
Die, scum.

12:21.260 --> 12:22.670
<i>Logic and practice.</i>

12:23.720 --> 12:27.430
<i>His ten years were spent meaningfully.</i>

12:27.430 --> 12:30.640
<i>It was a simulation without limits.</i>

12:31.430 --> 12:34.440
<i>Scientific research 
conducted within the mind.</i>

12:34.850 --> 12:39.820
<i>The ultimate environment to determine 
the most precise way to slaughter a nation.</i>

12:41.820 --> 12:49.330
<i>The only way for a non-witch to use magic 
is through written-style summoning magic.</i>

12:50.200 --> 12:54.250
<i>It is the practice of understanding and 
systematizing the mechanisms of magic</i>

12:54.250 --> 12:57.710
<i>and converting them into mathematical
 expressions using a special quill.</i>

12:57.710 --> 13:03.300
<i>Mastering it wouldn't have been easy 
without such an excellent teacher.</i>

13:04.590 --> 13:06.050
<i>To him,</i>

13:06.050 --> 13:11.600
<i>there was no difference between those who were
 present ten years ago and those who weren't.</i>

13:12.470 --> 13:14.230
<i>If killing her was your great purpose,</i>

13:14.230 --> 13:23.490
<i>then everyone who lives in this country 
and reaps the benefits is just as guilty!</i>

13:26.700 --> 13:29.240
<b>Written-Style
Summoning
Magic</b>

13:26.700 --> 13:29.240
<b>Bullet
Bell</b>

13:29.240 --> 13:31.910
An eye for an eye, right?

13:55.390 --> 13:57.560
What a beautiful sight!

13:59.900 --> 14:02.940
What is this?

14:06.530 --> 14:10.200
Let me feel better about this.

14:10.950 --> 14:14.200
Eekhout here. I've spotted the caster.

14:14.490 --> 14:16.960
He's in the palm of the giant's hand.

14:16.960 --> 14:19.040
Yes, that's correct.

14:19.040 --> 14:21.210
He matches the description of the boy.

14:21.500 --> 14:22.670
I see.

14:23.250 --> 14:29.970
All forces, the enemy is a long-term prisoner: 
the witch's apprentice, Adonis.

14:31.470 --> 14:33.970
He's in the palm of the giant's hand.

14:34.350 --> 14:37.480
Target confirmed. Commencing attack.

14:46.820 --> 14:48.150
All missiles on-target.

14:48.780 --> 14:49.910
<i>Continue the attack.</i>

14:49.910 --> 14:50.570
Yes, sir.

14:59.870 --> 15:01.170
The army's bombing the area!

15:01.170 --> 15:03.130
But we're still evacuating!

15:03.130 --> 15:04.500
Who cares? Just run!

15:04.500 --> 15:06.250
Get to a safe place!

15:05.210 --> 15:06.250
Mom!

15:06.250 --> 15:09.760
Mom! Wake up, Mom!

15:13.890 --> 15:14.760
What?

15:20.890 --> 15:25.520
I'm really sorry this is happening.

15:29.190 --> 15:30.820
Is everyone all right?

15:30.820 --> 15:32.780
Did the army defeat the giant?

15:32.780 --> 15:34.200
We need to get away from here.

15:34.200 --> 15:36.160
Where are you, honey?

15:36.530 --> 15:38.200
Please help this child.

15:39.200 --> 15:41.620
Get as far away from here as you can.

15:41.620 --> 15:43.670
I can't do that.

15:43.670 --> 15:46.000
This area is dangerous. Hurry.

15:46.000 --> 15:47.670
Wait. What about you?

15:48.340 --> 15:49.420
I'm...

15:50.160 --> 15:51.970
going to stop him.

15:55.760 --> 15:59.060
I must be out of shape.

16:03.980 --> 16:07.190
Meanwhile, at the Imperial Castle's Sanctum

16:06.560 --> 16:10.490
It's rather noisy outside.

16:10.900 --> 16:13.990
How long was I asleep?

16:14.740 --> 16:18.700
Redia Empire
23rd Emperor Goethe

16:15.160 --> 16:18.120
Only half an hour, darling.

16:20.330 --> 16:22.290
Don't worry about anything.

16:22.290 --> 16:24.710
You should rest for now.

16:24.710 --> 16:26.750
Our empire will be all right.

16:26.750 --> 16:31.720
After all, a certain emperor 
made sure it would be strong.

16:32.510 --> 16:34.720
You're too kind.

16:35.050 --> 16:42.770
Perhaps he could do that because 
he had a certain queen supporting him.

16:43.640 --> 16:44.230
Darling.

16:47.940 --> 16:51.230
But even that is coming to an end.

16:51.650 --> 16:54.990
An incurable illness, huh?

16:55.530 --> 16:58.950
Someone call Doctor Griffon. Hurry.

16:58.950 --> 17:00.740
Right away.

17:00.740 --> 17:03.080
No, it's fine.

17:03.080 --> 17:05.710
I'm all right.

17:07.710 --> 17:11.760
Is this a curse, God?

17:12.130 --> 17:16.260
I will not repent.

17:16.930 --> 17:24.350
We built a hyper-scientific civilization 
and burned our neighbors, the witches,

17:24.350 --> 17:27.520
for the sake of progress.

17:27.980 --> 17:36.030
The world and humanity could never 
advance as long as witches were around.

17:36.610 --> 17:43.120
Humanity must carve its own path alone.

17:44.370 --> 17:48.330
The new age has no need for magic.

17:48.330 --> 17:51.000
If anything, magic would 
only get in its way.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.880
So I can say this for certain.

17:53.880 --> 17:58.280
I did the right thing.

18:03.680 --> 18:05.390
It's raining.

18:05.390 --> 18:10.900
This rain will wash away 
your years of fatigue.

18:12.900 --> 18:19.660
You are a flower that blossomed 
on the path of carnage, my queen.

18:20.620 --> 18:22.120
They've been wiped out.

18:22.120 --> 18:23.280
Impossible.

18:23.280 --> 18:27.410
Sir, a civilian is approaching the target.

18:27.870 --> 18:29.040
What?

18:30.290 --> 18:32.170
I don't believe it.

18:32.670 --> 18:36.420
We should've killed you along 
with the witch ten years ago.

18:36.420 --> 18:38.680
Yeah, you should have.

18:39.220 --> 18:41.680
I wish you had.

18:41.680 --> 18:43.680
Stop!

18:48.060 --> 18:52.310
You were at the internment camp.

18:52.770 --> 18:56.190
Please, no more.

18:56.440 --> 19:01.160
You've taken the lives 
of many citizens of this empire.

19:01.160 --> 19:02.950
Haven't you done enough?

19:03.370 --> 19:08.120
I don't want to see any 
more innocent people die.

19:14.880 --> 19:16.340
How could you?

19:16.710 --> 19:18.880
Innocent, huh?

19:21.760 --> 19:23.720
Marvelous.

19:24.180 --> 19:27.720
How was I so confused?

19:27.720 --> 19:29.980
I should've thought more simply.

19:29.980 --> 19:34.770
Whether they're Redian or not, 
all humans are my enemies.

19:34.770 --> 19:39.150
Subjects for extermination, 
even if they're prisoners.

19:40.650 --> 19:42.490
Chloe wouldn't want this.

19:43.070 --> 19:44.490
What?

19:44.490 --> 19:46.950
She was important to you.

19:46.950 --> 19:49.000
I'm sure Chloe Morgan wouldn't—

19:49.000 --> 19:52.250
Don't casually speak her name, scum!

19:52.250 --> 19:54.630
Why would you get in my way, prisoner?

19:54.630 --> 19:57.750
Are you a distraction 
until the next wave arrives?

19:58.090 --> 20:00.260
Sounds like something humans would do.

20:00.260 --> 20:05.010
They always fight dirty, 
just like they did back then.

20:05.720 --> 20:11.140
There's no way we would've lost to humans 
if they hadn't used cheap tricks.

20:12.020 --> 20:15.900
You know nothing! Stay out of this!

20:15.900 --> 20:17.020
Adonis.

20:17.320 --> 20:23.280
It was the name the world's greatest 
witch gave to her beloved student.

20:24.530 --> 20:27.370
All us witches know it.

20:30.080 --> 20:32.000
You're a witch?

20:33.120 --> 20:34.290
Nice to meet you.

20:34.920 --> 20:36.750
I am Doroka the wi—

20:36.750 --> 20:38.040
Don't screw with me!

20:38.040 --> 20:39.550
Don't screw with me!

20:39.550 --> 20:41.970
All the witches are dead.

20:41.970 --> 20:45.800
Don't talk to me about witches, human scum.

20:45.800 --> 20:47.010
It's true.

20:47.010 --> 20:50.310
We survived the witch hunts.

20:50.310 --> 20:54.600
Then why didn't you come to save Chloe?

20:55.060 --> 20:57.560
Why did you let your fellow witch die?

20:58.400 --> 21:00.150
I'm sorry.

21:00.150 --> 21:02.820
We were all desperate to escape.

21:02.820 --> 21:04.860
I'm really sorry.

21:04.860 --> 21:07.820
Apologize all you want, 
but Chloe is already gone.

21:08.660 --> 21:11.240
Chloe will come back.

21:13.290 --> 21:15.290
We'll bring her back to life.

21:17.880 --> 21:20.090
Bring her back to life?

21:20.090 --> 21:22.880
Don't insult us any further.

21:23.170 --> 21:24.920
Listen to me, Adonis.

21:24.920 --> 21:28.640
I infiltrated this country to save you

21:28.640 --> 21:31.140
in order to bring back Chloe.

21:31.140 --> 21:34.020
We need your memories of her.

21:34.020 --> 21:37.900
We need you to resurrect Chloe.

21:41.070 --> 21:42.280
I'll kill you.

21:42.650 --> 21:44.900
I'll kill everyone who gets in my way.

21:44.940 --> 21:47.160
I'll kill everyone who defies me.

21:47.160 --> 21:49.490
I'll kill everyone who mocks Chloe.

21:49.490 --> 21:52.080
I'll kill everyone who speaks of Chloe.

21:52.080 --> 21:53.830
I'll kill everyone.

21:56.280 --> 21:57.420
Fine.

21:58.750 --> 22:01.170
If that will satisfy you.

22:01.670 --> 22:05.630
I'm glad I met you, Adonis.

22:21.730 --> 22:25.440
Is it true that you can bring her back?

22:25.440 --> 22:26.820
Yes.

22:28.780 --> 22:30.570
Come with me.

22:30.950 --> 22:35.200
You're not alone anymore, Adonis.

22:48.930 --> 22:49.800
What?

22:51.220 --> 22:54.220
Aw, what a disappointment.

22:54.220 --> 22:56.770
No two-for-one.
